# Maya on the jetty of Halcyon Cove (CIPlay halcyon_cove_talk, 11-12 w16 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). She fishes at
# the jetty's end (-2.25 82.6, deck 1.6). The crew's boathouse (shed x -12..-7.5, z 65.5..70, street 3.2; doorway -9.75 70)
# holds a chest padlocked until you have talked to her. Her answers: the cove (journal), bait (3 simple baits), leave.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island Halcyon Cove keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

at -9.75 72 h=4
walk -9.75 72 to -9.75 69 to -10.4 67.4 h=3.2
picture hc_boathouse -9.75 +2 74 -9.75 +1 68
open Crew's boathouse chest
expect message padlocked
at -2.25 79.5 h=2.5
walk -2.25 79.5 to -2.25 81 h=1.6
picture hc_maya -2.25 +1.5 78.5 -2.25 +0.8 82.6
use Maya pick 1
read Maya: the cove
use Maya pick 2
expect message three baits
expect item FishingBait_Simple 3
use Maya pick 3
expect message quarter past nine
at -9.75 72 h=4
walk -9.75 72 to -9.75 69 to -10.4 67.4 h=3.2
open Crew's boathouse chest
wait 2
expect item FishingBait_Advanced 2
expect item Rope 3
